1
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:22,589
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:43,530
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:46,913
=Episode 17=

4
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,159
Lin Lulu

5
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,119
is actually just another

6
00:00:51,119 --> 00:00:53,240
poor woman deceived by Zhang Haotian.

7
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:56,159
Someone like her, a hopeless romantic,

8
00:00:56,159 --> 00:00:58,119
has to learn the hard way.

9
00:00:58,119 --> 00:01:00,560
She thinks anyone who disagrees
is hurting her.

10
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:02,399
Well,

11
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:04,079
what about Su Qinglan?

12
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:07,000
Su Qinglan...

13
00:01:09,519 --> 00:01:11,480
The day I took Su Qinglan
to the hospital,

14
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,719
Zhang Haotian's reaction was strange.

15
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:16,319
He was absolutely furious.

16
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,480
I think

17
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:20,079
he might have been the one
behind Su Qinglan's death.

18
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,640
I have a feeling,

19
00:01:22,159 --> 00:01:24,280
if we follow this lead,

20
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:25,959
we can bring Zhang Haotian

21
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,599
to justice.

22
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,159
Ms. Lin.

23
00:01:37,603 --> 00:01:38,959
I'm here to see Haotian.

24
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:41,719
How is he?

25
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:42,799
He just took his medicine
and fell asleep.

26
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,519
Medicine?

27
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,719
What's wrong with Haotian?

28
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:45,560
Is he sick?

29
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,879
Why didn't he go to the hospital?

30
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:49,599
Keep your voice down.

31
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:50,599
It could trigger him.

32
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:53,599
Have a seat.

33
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:02,480
It's antidepressants.

34
00:02:02,799 --> 00:02:03,760
Antidepressants?

35
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,599
Your affair really hurt Haotian...

36
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:06,680
I didn't!

37
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:08,319
I didn't cheat on him.

38
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,039
Don't get worked up.

39
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,159
I know.

40
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:13,319
Your affair hurt Haotian deeply.

41
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:14,120
You know

42
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,879
Haotian is an orphan.

43
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:17,759
He gave all his love to you.

44
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,080
But you...

45
00:02:19,759 --> 00:02:20,479
Can...

46
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:23,120
Can you help me explain to him?

47
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,800
I didn't. I really...

48
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,400
I really didn't!

49
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,000
It's only been a few days,

50
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,319
and he's already self-harming
and depressed.

51
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:36,240
If this continues,

52
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:38,879
Haotian won't be able to take it.

53
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:42,879
Ms. Lin,

54
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:44,800
please think about what Haotian said.

55
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:45,800
(Lulu...)

56
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,280
(Let me go.)

57
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:50,360
No. I don't want a divorce.

58
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,680
I don't want a divorce.

59
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,159
I won't divorce him.

60
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:54,319
I know.

61
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:57,159
Can you

62
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:58,719
talk to him for me?

63
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,560
Please?

64
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,039
How about this?

65
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:01,599
I will

66
00:03:01,719 --> 00:03:03,400
go talk some sense into Haotian again.

67
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:04,960
Don't worry.

68
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,680
Okay.

69
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,000
Go home and wait for now.

70
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,520
I'll do everything I can to help you.

71
00:03:09,223 --> 00:03:11,240
You have to help me talk to him.

72
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:12,479
Don't worry.

73
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:13,960
Go home.

74
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,680
She's gone.

75
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,800
Should we push her a little harder?

76
00:03:41,639 --> 00:03:43,360
Otherwise, she won't bring up divorce.

77
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,360
I'll handle it.

78
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,759
Get me a paternity test.

79
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:51,960
A paternity test?

80
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:58,360
Between whom?

81
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:00,280
Don't ask.

82
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:03,960
You won't even tell me?

83
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,120
Fine.

84
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,360
Then I'll go.

85
00:04:07,639 --> 00:04:08,439
I'll let you know if I find anything.

86
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:14,120
(I still can't figure it out.)

87
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:17,040
(Why would Su Qinglan contact Zhao Ke?)

88
00:04:20,079 --> 00:04:22,680
(Ms. Su called me and asked me
to go over.)

89
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,959
(You love investigating, don't you?)

90
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:24,800
(Go ahead. Look into it.)

91
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:27,560
(Even if you glare at me,)

92
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,800
(I still don't know what she wanted
to tell me.)

93
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,720
(She had already passed out
when I got there.)

94
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:34,480
(My instincts tell me there's something
between Su Qinglan and Zhao Ke.)

95
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:36,480
(I'll know once I check.)

96
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,720
What?

97
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:40,160
Come to my place and talk?

98
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,360
Okay.

99
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:47,639
(Zhao Mai is after me.)

100
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:50,920
(She probably approached
Zhao Ke on purpose.)

101
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:53,160
(I can't let my problems)

102
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:55,360
(put Zhao Ke in danger.)

103
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,839
Mr. Zhang is here too.

104
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,279
You're still working here?

105
00:05:12,439 --> 00:05:13,839
Wasn't the money I gave you enough?

106
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,000
We're not even together yet,

107
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,199
and you're already trying to control me?

108
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:18,319
Isn't it just a divorce?

109
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,240
I'm working on it.

110
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,879
Then come back when it's finalized.

111
00:05:22,439 --> 00:05:24,279
Don't have anything to do with Zhao Mai
anymore.

112
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:26,279
I've made myself clear.

113
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,639
She's dangerous when she loses control.

114
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,240
Cut ties with her.

115
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:35,240
Come with me.

116
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,680
I'll protect you.

117
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,399
I've already made myself clear.

118
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:43,000
Come find me after the divorce.

119
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,279
What are you doing?

120
00:05:45,879 --> 00:05:47,399
Zhao Mai is very calculating.

121
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:48,600
You can't beat her.

122
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,279
Come with me.

123
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,839
Whatever you're trying to do,

124
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,480
I'll do it for you.

125
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,959
Zhao Mai, are you okay?

126
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:06,279
Do you need my help?

127
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,160
No.

128
00:06:08,639 --> 00:06:09,439
Really, I'm fine.

129
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:11,040
Zhao Mai.

130
00:06:15,959 --> 00:06:16,879
Your back...

131
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:18,600
These scars...

132
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,319
I got them back then

133
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,079
when I saved Zhang Haotian.

134
00:06:23,383 --> 00:06:25,404
(Drowning in Memories)

135
00:06:26,031 --> 00:06:30,129
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

136
00:06:30,937 --> 00:06:33,749
♪I should forget you♪

137
00:06:34,218 --> 00:06:39,295
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

138
00:06:39,319 --> 00:06:41,159
♪To carry on♪

139
00:06:41,415 --> 00:06:46,272
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

140
00:06:46,638 --> 00:06:48,526
♪You no longer have the strength♪

141
00:06:50,825 --> 00:06:53,706
♪You want me to go there for you♪

142
00:06:55,274 --> 00:07:00,712
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

143
00:07:01,306 --> 00:07:04,445
♪Your freedom♪

144
00:07:05,145 --> 00:07:09,576
♪Has become my cage♪

145
00:07:10,504 --> 00:07:16,295
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

146
00:07:17,646 --> 00:07:23,496
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

147
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:29,906
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

148
00:07:30,186 --> 00:07:33,436
♪You told me♪

149
00:07:33,833 --> 00:07:38,339
♪I would shine like a star♪

150
00:07:39,183 --> 00:07:43,300
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

151
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:47,380
♪How to live without you♪

152
00:07:47,599 --> 00:07:53,424
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

153
00:07:54,945 --> 00:07:58,729
♪So hazy and blurred♪
